61	Random stagnates (reward 0.14--0.19, $f_0 \approx 0.33$); Standard exhibits borderline collapse ($f_0 \geq 0.50$, peak reward 0.081); \rasp{} collapses fully ($f_0 > 0.675$, reward declining to 0.010).
